          }
        ],
        "text": "The majority held that \u00a7\u202f1231, not \u00a7\u202f1226, governs respondents\u2019 detention and that they are not entitled to bond hearings while seeking withholding of removal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "27dd16f9c7089148e6a9cea4eaf12ff2edc2c91a229684885329cf93cf354270",
