              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Barrett asked whether post\u2011order custody review regulations automatically apply after the 90\u2011day removal period."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f19b7e17b04e7cdedc4943e01c8a0f15ef697b7c638a50382c3742c2dada76fa",
