                "end": 5,
                "start": 5
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel), according to Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel), petitioners argued that respondents are detained under \u00a7\u202f1231, not \u00a7\u202f1226, because the text of \u00a7\u202f1231 repeatedly refers to an order of removal."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "f19b7e17b04e7cdedc4943e01c8a0f15ef697b7c638a50382c3742c2dada76fa",
              "evidence_ids": [
