              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 17,
                "start": 17
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel), according to Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel), they noted that the supervised release conditions in \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(3) require periodic appearances before an immigration officer and compliance with medical examinations and conduct restrictions."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "f19b7e17b04e7cdedc4943e01c8a0f15ef697b7c638a50382c3742c2dada76fa",
              "evidence_ids": [
