              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 14,
                "start": 14
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel), according to Vivek Suri (Petitioners' counsel), they argued that the 90\u2011day removal period in \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(1)(A) should not preclude detention when withholding\u2011only proceedings last longer."
        }
      ],
